<title>AUSTRALIA: Aristocrat Leisure sees continued growth.</title>
<headline>Aristocrat Leisure sees continued growth.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaming machine manufacturer Aristocrat Leisure Ltd said on Monday in its annual profit results that it expected continued growth in the current year to June 30, 1998.</p>
</text>
